title: "Romanian Hospital Medical Waste Procurement Dataset (CPV 90524*), v2"
version: "2.0.2"
date-released: "2026-09-26"
message: "If you use the medical waste dataset, please cite it using the metadata below; for the medical devices dataset (CPV 33*) cite the entry under references (DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22969660). Version 1 (June–September 2026) is withdrawn; see CHANGELOG.md."
authors:
  - name: "Licitații Medicale"
    website: "https://licitatiimedicale.com"
    email: "info@licitatiimedicale.com"
