license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://licitatiimedicale.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/licitatiimedicale/data"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22969690"
abstract: >
  Public procurement procedures for hazardous medical waste services (CPV 90524*)
  awarded by public hospitals in Romania, 2018-2026: one row per procedure (291),
  built from TED award notices read from XML (eForms and F03), the contract notices
  they reference, and SICAP records published through OpenTender/OCDS (2020-2024).
  Framework agreements are counted once; duration and value sources are given per row;
  every raw record is traceable to its procedure. Version 2 replaces version 1,
  which contained systematic counting errors. The same repository also holds the
  medical devices dataset (CPV 33* without 336*, 16,072 procedures), built with the
  same script and rules and cited separately (see references).
keywords:
  - public procurement
  - Romania
  - medical waste
  - hospitals
  - CPV 90524
  - TED
  - SICAP
  - open data
